<title>GERMANY: Springer to launch youth &quot;Sport Bild&quot;.</title>
<headline>Springer to launch youth &quot;Sport Bild&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German publishing group Axel Springer Verlag AG said on Wednesday it would launch a new &quot;Sport Bild&quot; magazine for youths by the end of November.</p>
<p>Springer expected initial publication of the newspaper, to be called &quot;Young Sport Bild,&quot; to total about one million copies. It will be targeted at readers between the ages of 10 and 17.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
